ext.25_50_per_musician.935ce2d0":"每位音乐家 $25–$50","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.or_one_envelope_to_the_bandleader.2513be9a":"或者给乐队领队一个信封","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.photographer_videographer.6c281c57":"摄影师/摄像师","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.50_200_flat_optional.1f38cde7":"$50–$200 固定，可选","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.often_the_business_owner_a_review_matter.9e4f3609":"通常是企业主——评论更重要","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.officiant.62120c94":"司仪","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.50_100.fc9495c7":"$50–$100","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.or_a_donation_to_their_house_of_worship.2c9641a7":"或者向他们的礼拜堂捐款","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.planner_coordinator.4e3b264b":"计划员/协调员","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.50_200_optional.7a97232c":"$50–$200，可选","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.not_expected_if_they_own_the_business.b99bec1e":"如果他们拥有该企业，则预计不会","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.transport_delivery_crew.5f5aae90":"运输/送货人员","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.15_20_of_fare_5_20_each.6894c220":"票价的 15–20% / 每份 5–20 美元","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.check_whether_gratuity_was_pre_added.7a23451d":"检查是否已预先添加小费","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.h2_text.what_couples_actually_did_in_2026.4d90e4f1":"2026 年夫妻实际上做了什么","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.span_text.zola_s_2026_wedding_spend_survey_asked_7.c62c031c":"Zola 的 2026 年婚礼支出调查询问了 720 对婚礼后六个月内的夫妇，他们给了谁小费：","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.strong_text.caterers_73_hair_and_makeup_71_photograp.43a6123d":"餐饮服务商 73%、发型和化妆 71%、摄影师 70%、DJ 或乐队 67%、策划者 48%","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.span_text.zola_suggests_budgeting_roughly_5_10_of.d914e943":"。佐拉建议将婚礼总费用的大约 5-10% 预算为小费。大多数夫妇会在当天分发现金，因此实际工作是在场地日之前计算出总额，而不是之后。","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.h2_text.how_to_hand_it_over.c791c649":"如何移交","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.p_text.a_week_before_the_wedding_withdraw_the_c.ddc78245":"婚礼前一周，取出现金，并将每笔金额放入贴有标签、贴有供应商姓名的信封中。请值得信赖的人（伴郎、伴娘或协调员）在每个供应商结束时分发它们。每个信封内附有一封简短的感谢信，大有裨益。使用打印/PDF 作为信封列表。如果供应商拥有该企业，则可以给予小费，但不期望给予小费；五星级的评论和推荐更有价值。这是美国的惯例指南——欧洲各地的小费预期有所不同，因此请检查当地针对目的地婚礼的规范。","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.span_text.want_to_see_the_whole_picture_put_these.08c0c3cb":"想看全貌吗？将这些数字放在","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.budget_calculator.060f44a9":"预算计算器","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.span_text.and_the.24576d62":"和","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.planning_checklist.2c358079":"规划清单","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.h2_text.frequently_asked_questions.af2a4d28":"常见问题","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.summary_text.do_i_tip_if_there_is_already_a_service_c.86b2a66e":"如果已经收取服务费，我需要给小费吗？","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.p_text.not_necessarily_a_service_charge_of_18_2.1613236f":"未必。 18-24% 的服务费通常是房费，而不是小费。询问餐饮或场地经理是否分发给工作人员。如果是，您就受到保障；如果不是，请直接给工作人员小费，但切勿两次支付单独的小费。","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.summary_text.how_much_should_i_tip_a_wedding_photogra.bff14b4e":"我应该给婚礼摄影师多少小费？","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.p_text.a_flat_50_200_is_customary_and_it_is_opt.da1651c9":"固定价格为 50 至 200 美元是惯例，也是可选的——许多摄影师拥有自己的业务并自行设定价格。也给第二射手和助手小费；五星级的评论和推荐通常比现金更有价值。","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.summary_text.do_you_tip_the_wedding_dj.e786a08c":"你会给婚礼 DJ 小费吗？","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.p_text.yes_10_15_of_the_fee_or_a_flat_50_150_fo.87a85af0":"是的，独奏 DJ 需支付 10-15% 的费用或固定 50-150 美元。对于乐队来说，每位音乐家 25 至 50 美元，或者将一个信封交给乐队领队，由他们平分。在接待结束时将其移交。","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.summary_text.how_much_do_most_couples_spend_on_weddin.d6eb1e55":"大多数夫妇在婚礼小费上总共花了多少钱？","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.p_text.ranked_guides_put_a_mid_size_us_wedding.4d79119d":"排名指南认为美国中型婚礼的价格约为 500 至 1,000 美元以上，2026 年的一些预算型号达到 1,500 至 4,000 美元，举办 100 名宾客的婚礼并提供完整的供应商名单。佐拉建议预算婚礼总费用的 5-10%。","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.summary_text.should_i_tip_a_vendor_who_owns_the_busin.a3cef2ab":"我应该给拥有该企业的供应商小费吗？","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.p_text.a_tip_is_appreciated_but_not_expected_th.599504d2":"给小费是值得的，但不是期望的——他们自己定价。将现金小费重点放在员工和员工身上。衷心的评论、推荐或感谢信都是很好的选择。","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.summary_text.when_and_how_are_tips_handed_out.a77df3b8":"何时以及如何发放小费？","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.p_text.in_cash_on_the_wedding_day_prepare_label.f3bd5f22":"婚礼当天，现金支付。提前一周准备好贴有标签的信封，并请一位值得信赖的人（协调员、伴郎或伴娘）在供应商完成后分发它们。从此页打印信封列表，这样就不会忘记任何内容。","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.h2_text.more_free_wedding_tools.511ec8cc":"更多免费婚礼工具","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.budget_calculator.4a2217e0":"预算计算器","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.seating_chart.0aa1b5db":"座位表","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.hashtag_generator.f0d774ee":"话题标签生成器","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.invitation_maker.eaa060de":"请柬制作工具","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.save_the_date.f3ad2c82":"婚期预告","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.photo_book_planner.a9887dd0":"照片书策划师","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.photo_collage.942e207a":"照片拼贴","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.heic_to_jpg.67ca8d18":"HEIC 转 JPG","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.planning_checklist.8d9c7c04":"婚礼筹备清单","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.alcohol_calculator.aa6ed7fc":"酒水计算器","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.vow_writer.90e3a3d2":"婚礼誓词撰写工具","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.speech_writer.7bd24d35":"致辞撰写","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.guest_count_calculator.3713f2ea":"宾客人数计算器","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.h2_text.planning_done_let_s_make_the_film.acbc362d":"筹备完成了吗？来拍一部婚礼电影吧。","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.p_text.turn_the_photos_and_words_from_your_plan.8830dc77":"将您计划中的照片和文字变成 60-90 秒的电影婚礼影片